{"format":1,"id":"atem_beobachten","kurz":"ab","sprache":"en","richtung":"ltr","titel":"Breath awareness","untertitel":"Let the breath come and go. When the mind wanders, kindly come back.","haltung":["sitzen","liegen"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":300},"normal":{"ziel_s":600},"lang":{"ziel_s":1200}},"kb":960,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/1.0c4c9861.mp3","ms":3789,"text":"Sit comfortably and upright, or lie down on your back.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/2.c0b9c4d7.mp3","ms":6272,"text":"If you like, close your eyes. You can also keep them open and lower your gaze.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/3.073c13df.mp3","ms":3484,"text":"You can stop at any time if something doesn't feel right.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3}},{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/4.c182b0a2.mp3","ms":7160,"text":"Notice how your body is supported. By the chair, by the floor, by whatever is beneath you.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/5.b54589d3.mp3","ms":2074,"text":"Let your shoulders drop a little.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/6.a96bf3a0.mp3","ms":1636,"text":"And let your face soften.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":3,"lang":5}}]},{"id":"atem","segmente":[{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/7.641c54fe.mp3","ms":2453,"text":"Now bring your attention to your breath.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/8.32411025.mp3","ms":4740,"text":"There's nothing to change. The breath comes and goes on its own.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/9.e880d78a.mp3","ms":6729,"text":"Find a place where you can feel it clearly. At the nostrils, in the chest, or in the belly.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/10.ddd9abcd.mp3","ms":4355,"text":"Feel the breath as it flows in. And as it flows out.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/11.82a896d3.mp3","ms":5616,"text":"If focusing on the breath feels uncomfortable, you can listen to the sounds around you instead.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/12.3a38d20c.mp3","ms":5425,"text":"Or feel your feet on the floor. Then that is where you come back to each time.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/13.086133f6.mp3","ms":3545,"text":"Perhaps you notice your belly gently rising and falling.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/14.2d3c5454.mp3","ms":5750,"text":"Or how the air comes in a little cooler through the nose. And leaves a little warmer.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":9.5}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":39.9,"normal":58.1,"lang":71.3}}]},{"id":"abschweifen","segmente":[{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/15.ccd6f2b2.mp3","ms":7225,"text":"Sooner or later, your mind will wander off. That's completely normal, it's what minds do.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/16.5a1fdbd4.mp3","ms":4279,"text":"As soon as you notice, silently say to yourself: thinking.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s017","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/17.9b717320.mp3","ms":3004,"text":"And kindly bring your attention back to the breath.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s018","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/18.7a26e9ea.mp3","ms":5209,"text":"You're not doing anything wrong. Coming back is the practice itself.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st02","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":39.9,"normal":58.1,"lang":71.3}},{"id":"s019","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/19.720d24fc.mp3","ms":5142,"text":"Feel the next breath, from beginning to end. Just this one.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st03","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":39.9,"normal":58.1,"lang":71.3}},{"id":"s020","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/20.b19777f8.mp3","ms":5205,"text":"Where is your mind right now? If it has wandered, simply come back.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s021","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/21.5495c6be.mp3","ms":1386,"text":"To this one breath.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st04","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":58.1,"lang":71.3}},{"id":"s022","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/22.fcf72c55.mp3","ms":4926,"text":"Perhaps there's restlessness, or boredom. That can be here too.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s023","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/23.5fe2e4c1.mp3","ms":2618,"text":"Notice it, and return to the breath.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s024","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/24.0ce86888.mp3","ms":2040,"text":"Each breath is a fresh start.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st05","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":58.1,"lang":71.3}},{"id":"s025","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/25.e4947855.mp3","ms":5018,"text":"Notice where the in-breath begins. And where the out-breath ends.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":8}},{"id":"s026","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/26.e1b10ced.mp3","ms":3625,"text":"There may be a small pause before the next breath arrives.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":8}},{"id":"st06","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":71.3}},{"id":"s027","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/27.ff5116e4.mp3","ms":6057,"text":"If you feel drowsy, sit up a little straighter. Or open your eyes for a moment.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st07","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":71.3}},{"id":"s028","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/28.f7e1a4ff.mp3","ms":6359,"text":"If a feeling becomes strong, you can simply notice it. And then return to the breath.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st08","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":71.3}},{"id":"s029","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/29.df5d6910.mp3","ms":4631,"text":"There's nothing to achieve. Just notice, and come back.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":8}},{"id":"st09","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":71.3}}]},{"id":"weiten","segmente":[{"id":"s030","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/30.3ddeecb1.mp3","ms":2113,"text":"Now let your attention widen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s031","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/31.e93bee98.mp3","ms":3933,"text":"Sense your whole body, sitting or lying here, breathing.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3,"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"s032","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/32.911f0481.mp3","ms":3718,"text":"Sounds, thoughts and sensations can come and go.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":5,"lang":8}},{"id":"st10","art":"stille","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"kurz":39.9,"normal":58.1,"lang":71.3}},{"id":"s033","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/33.f683d962.mp3","ms":3185,"text":"Stay like this for a while, open and awake.","in":["lang"],"pause_s":{"lang":6.5}},{"id":"st11","art":"stille","in":["lang"],"dauer_s":{"lang":71.3}}]},{"id":"rueckkehr","segmente":[{"id":"s034","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/34.35fe177f.mp3","ms":3198,"text":"Slowly, this practice is coming to an end.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s035","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/35.71d56f67.mp3","ms":3845,"text":"Take one slightly deeper breath in. And out.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s036","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/36.c5dec524.mp3","ms":1973,"text":"Move your fingers and toes.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s037","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/37.d6fc1ed9.mp3","ms":2336,"text":"When you're ready, open your eyes.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s038","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/38.db6a44e4.mp3","ms":4619,"text":"Perhaps you can take a little of this calm with you into whatever comes next.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s039","art":"sprache","datei":"ab/39.3e698df9.mp3","ms":2818,"text":"If you've been lying down, get up slowly.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":1,"normal":2,"lang":3}},{"id":"glocke","art":"glocke","ton":"ende"}]}]}